# DEPLOY.md - {{app_name}}

The deploy runbook for {{app_name}}. Exact commands only. Host: Vercel. Backend: Supabase project `{{supabase_project_ref}}`. Keep this current after every deploy. No em dashes anywhere in this file.

## 0. Prerequisites / tooling preamble

- Vercel CLI authenticated: `vercel whoami` returns `{{vercel_user}}` (org `{{vercel_org}}`).
- Supabase access token exported: `export SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=sbp_...` (never commit it).
- MCP gotcha: a Supabase MCP server added mid-session is not callable until the session restarts. For immediate work use the CLI/token path below.
- Monorepo Root Directory: `{{root_directory}}`  <!-- TODO: per-app, e.g. apps/web or apps/admin -->
- Vercel plan: Pro (required for commercial/client deploys; Hobby prohibits commercial use).

## 1. Env matrix

See the full matrix in the env-matrix table below (or `env-matrix.template.md`). Default to the new Supabase key names; legacy names noted where the live project still uses them.

| Variable | Scope | Environments | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` | client | prod, preview | set to the vercel.app URL first, swap to custom domain later |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` | client | prod, preview, dev | |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLIC_KEY` | client | prod, preview, dev | `sb_publishable_...` (new) |
| `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY` | server-only | prod, preview | `sb_secret_...` (new); legacy: `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` |
| `{{external_secret}}` | server-only | prod, preview | e.g. `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, `RESEND_API_KEY` |

